All right.

2072
01:21:49,148 --> 01:21:50,788
I'll keep in touch from now on.

2073
01:21:50,918 --> 01:21:51,988
Okay.

2074
01:21:55,458 --> 01:21:57,358
(My goodness)

2075
01:21:58,028 --> 01:22:00,458
- I'm sorry, everyone. - What?

2076
01:22:00,528 --> 01:22:02,368
- Why are you apologizing? - Don't be.

2077
01:22:02,868 --> 01:22:04,768
(Looking around)

2078
01:22:05,038 --> 01:22:06,138
What's...

2079
01:22:06,298 --> 01:22:07,768
- I mean... - What's up with this atmosphere?

2080
01:22:07,768 --> 01:22:09,168
Please read the room.

2081
01:22:09,468 --> 01:22:10,738
I just don't understand.

2082
01:22:10,738 --> 01:22:12,278
- Just be quiet. - Each one...

2083
01:22:12,378 --> 01:22:14,278
- Each one feels differently. - That's right.

2084
01:22:14,278 --> 01:22:16,048
(I see!)

2085
01:22:17,078 --> 01:22:18,348
It's the best gift.

2086
01:22:18,348 --> 01:22:20,548
Whenever the Teachers' Day comes,

2087
01:22:20,578 --> 01:22:22,188
I say to my students,

2088
01:22:22,418 --> 01:22:26,758
"My favorite gift is a letter."

2089
01:22:27,018 --> 01:22:29,728
"I understand the emotions this letter contains."

2090
01:22:30,628 --> 01:22:33,828
After 30 years, you wrote me a letter.

2091
01:22:33,828 --> 01:22:37,368
I'm so sorry that it's short.

2092
01:22:37,838 --> 01:22:39,868
It wasn't a long letter,

2093
01:22:40,138 --> 01:22:42,608
but I made sure to put my sincerity into it.

2094
01:22:43,538 --> 01:22:45,838
I couldn't hold back the tears then.

2095
01:22:46,008 --> 01:22:49,378
It seemed like he was saying, "You did well."

2096
01:22:49,508 --> 01:22:52,248
At that moment...

2097
01:22:52,518 --> 01:22:53,748
- He went back to the past. - Yes.

2098
01:22:53,748 --> 01:22:56,548
I thought, "I finally met my teacher."

2099
01:22:57,088 --> 01:22:58,818
I'll cherish it.

2100
01:22:59,918 --> 01:23:01,088
Thank you so much.

2101
01:23:01,188 --> 01:23:02,288
Mr. Park.

2102
01:23:03,758 --> 01:23:05,158
I also brought a gift.

2103
01:23:05,758 --> 01:23:07,998
It's really small.

2104
01:23:08,198 --> 01:23:09,298
It's nothing.

2105
01:23:10,328 --> 01:23:11,798
- Thank you. - I found it on my way here.

2106
01:23:13,338 --> 01:23:15,308
(He picks up food after delivering what he prepared.)

2107
01:23:17,508 --> 01:23:19,238
(My goodness)

2108
01:23:20,608 --> 01:23:21,978
My heart feels light.

2109
01:23:22,948 --> 01:23:24,178
Please give them to us.

2110
01:23:24,348 --> 01:23:25,818
- Happy family and chili shrimp. - Okay.

2111
01:23:25,818 --> 01:23:27,988
- The food is served. - The food is served.

2112
01:23:28,448 --> 01:23:29,488
(Dishes fill the table.)

2113
01:23:29,488 --> 01:23:30,588
- He ordered a lot. - It's nice.

2114
01:23:30,588 --> 01:23:31,658
Thank you.

2115
01:23:32,018 --> 01:23:33,418
(Chinese dishes fill the table.)

2116
01:23:33,418 --> 01:23:35,758
Happy family. He ordered many dishes.

2117
01:23:36,488 --> 01:23:38,828
Please taste a little bit of each.

2118
01:23:38,828 --> 01:23:39,998
How many servings did you order?

2119
01:23:39,998 --> 01:23:41,768
I don't know. I ordered the dishes...

2120
01:23:41,768 --> 01:23:42,998
without thinking.

2121
01:23:43,728 --> 01:23:44,868
You did well.

2122
01:23:45,438 --> 01:23:48,608
Seriously. So many memories are flooding back.

2123
01:23:50,138 --> 01:23:51,638
Please eat a lot, Mr. Park.

2124
01:23:56,648 --> 01:23:57,878
(Glancing over)

2125
01:24:02,318 --> 01:24:04,088
(The food tastes better since it's from Dae Ho.)

2126
01:24:04,088 --> 01:24:06,218
- You ordered various dishes. - That's right.

2127
01:24:06,388 --> 01:24:08,388
(Proud)

2128
01:24:08,858 --> 01:24:10,128
By the way,

2129
01:24:10,828 --> 01:24:13,398
you aren't planning to continue living alone,

2130
01:24:13,398 --> 01:24:14,598
are you?

2131
01:24:14,598 --> 01:24:17,368
Of course not. I'm not celibate.

2132
01:24:17,698 --> 01:24:19,698
But if I get hung up...

2133
01:24:19,698 --> 01:24:22,408
on the idea of marriage,

2134
01:24:22,638 --> 01:24:24,238
my life won't be fun.

2135
01:24:24,238 --> 01:24:27,078
So I plan to let things happen naturally.

2136
01:24:27,078 --> 01:24:29,608
- Who knows where my fated one is? - That's right.

2137
01:24:29,608 --> 01:24:31,218
- I'll meet people. - I hope you'll meet people.

2138
01:24:31,218 --> 01:24:32,278
- That's right. - People.

2139
01:24:32,318 --> 01:24:34,378
It has been so long since I dated someone.

2140
01:24:34,718 --> 01:24:36,188
It has been over nine years.

2141
01:24:37,118 --> 01:24:39,788
Around next year, you'll become...

2142
01:24:39,788 --> 01:24:41,888
- even more popular. - My goodness.

2143
01:24:41,888 --> 01:24:43,928
I'll work even harder.

2144
01:24:43,928 --> 01:24:47,758
I'll live diligently so that you can brag about me.

2145
01:24:47,898 --> 01:24:49,098
Oh, my.

2146
01:24:49,098 --> 01:24:50,128
(Proud)

2147
01:24:50,268 --> 01:24:52,938
Each person can influence me in a different way.

2148
01:24:52,938 --> 01:24:55,338
I think that's what a teacher does to you.

2149
01:24:56,208 --> 01:24:58,408
It's hard to survive in this society.

2150
01:24:58,578 --> 01:25:00,138
Society is cutthroat.

2151
01:25:00,138 --> 01:25:02,878
After all, you need to take responsibility for everything.

2152
01:25:02,908 --> 01:25:06,218
Your life is made up of your choices.

2153
01:25:06,218 --> 01:25:08,148
I chose this life,

2154
01:25:08,148 --> 01:25:10,388
but the weight of it felt too heavy...

2155
01:25:10,518 --> 01:25:11,718
in the past three months.

2156
01:25:12,358 --> 01:25:15,058
In some moments, I didn't seem like myself.

2157
01:25:15,058 --> 01:25:16,658
There were greed...

2158
01:25:16,658 --> 01:25:18,398
and hastiness.

2159
01:25:18,758 --> 01:25:20,758
The three months you experience after going freelance...

2160
01:25:20,758 --> 01:25:23,268
are like the awkwardness you feel after transferring to a new school.

2161
01:25:23,268 --> 01:25:25,168
That must be it.

2162
01:25:26,638 --> 01:25:28,138
- I think you're right. - That must be it.

2163
01:25:28,138 --> 01:25:30,268
- I had to read the room. - That's the vibe.

2164
01:25:30,638 --> 01:25:32,338
- The two instances overlapped. - Yes.

2165
01:25:32,338 --> 01:25:33,538
- I guess. - It's natural to remember...

2166
01:25:33,538 --> 01:25:34,778
the one who was so good to you.

2167
01:25:34,778 --> 01:25:35,808
You're right.

2168
01:25:36,508 --> 01:25:38,418
I think that's what a teacher does to you.

2169
01:25:40,248 --> 01:25:43,318
He listens to your stories.

2170
01:25:45,188 --> 01:25:48,858
He sees my tears without a misunderstanding.

2171
01:25:51,258 --> 01:25:53,928
Tears fell down my cheeks.

2172
01:25:54,768 --> 01:25:56,698
It was a therapeutic experience.

2173
01:25:57,698 --> 01:26:00,998
I think that's the power a teacher has.

2174
01:26:01,408 --> 01:26:02,468
A teacher.

2175
01:26:03,068 --> 01:26:06,478
When I'm in front of my teacher, I become an elementary schooler.

2176
01:26:07,138 --> 01:26:08,808
I'll live diligently.

2177
01:26:09,078 --> 01:26:10,978
I bet it was a therapeutic experience.

2178
01:26:10,978 --> 01:26:12,448
(To My Turbulent 40s)

2179
01:26:13,748 --> 01:26:15,188
(Next story)

2180
01:26:16,188 --> 01:26:17,318
(Are these tools waiting for an operation?)

2181
01:26:18,058 --> 01:26:19,088
(It takes techniques.)

2182
01:26:19,658 --> 01:26:22,258
(My hands are shaking.)

2183
01:26:22,428 --> 01:26:23,488
Do you see the roe?

2184
01:26:23,988 --> 01:26:24,998
(Roe?)

2185
01:26:25,258 --> 01:26:27,898
(I came to see Brother Fish Roe.)

2186
01:26:28,468 --> 01:26:30,028
(A workroom in Mount Jiri that's full of the master's secrets)

2187
01:26:30,798 --> 01:26:32,338
(I'll teach you everything about fish roe.)

2188
01:26:33,098 --> 01:26:35,708
(The first step of becoming Sister Fish Roe)

2189
01:26:35,908 --> 01:26:37,208
If it's humid, wipe them twice.

2190
01:26:37,208 --> 01:26:38,608
The water is clear in Mount Jiri.

2191
01:26:38,608 --> 01:26:42,778
(A 4-month journey to get fish roe of the highest quality)

2192
01:26:43,048 --> 01:26:44,148
(Eat a lot.)

2193
01:26:44,948 --> 01:26:46,078
(A Mount Jiri meal with 13 side dishes)

2194
01:26:46,518 --> 01:26:48,118
(Ground elder, chili leaves, gomchwi, castor aralia shoots,)

2195
01:26:48,118 --> 01:26:49,388
(aster scaber, radish greens, bracken)

2196
01:26:50,088 --> 01:26:52,318
(The local invigorating food brings happiness to her mouth.)

2197
01:26:53,558 --> 01:26:57,158
(A neighbor, Jeon Yu Seong appears.)

2198
01:26:57,828 --> 01:26:59,998
(Are there single men who farm by themselves?)

2199
01:27:01,058 --> 01:27:03,368
(Many people find a spouse upon moving here.)

2200
01:27:04,668 --> 01:27:08,268
(Will she have a blind date in Mount Jiri?)

2201
01:27:10,408 --> 01:27:12,008
(She'll make love as well as dried fish roe.)

2202
01:27:12,978 --> 01:27:16,648
(A Day That's Full of Roe)

2203
01:27:17,378 --> 01:27:18,948
(He carries a plate of fruit...)

2204
01:27:18,948 --> 01:27:20,778
(and lies down on the floor.)

2205
01:27:21,688 --> 01:27:23,518
(To take care of my health,)

2206
01:27:24,288 --> 01:27:25,288
(I came to my parents' place!)

2207
01:27:25,618 --> 01:27:27,818
(Recently, I went to the emergency room.)

2208
01:27:28,488 --> 01:27:29,488
(Allergy to antibiotics)

2209
01:27:29,658 --> 01:27:30,658
(Shortness of breath)
(Aerotitis)

2210
01:27:32,128 --> 01:27:33,658
(What should I do?)

2211
01:27:33,828 --> 01:27:35,028
(I should rest.)

2212
01:27:35,028 --> 01:27:36,398
(I'm hungry.)

2213
01:27:36,828 --> 01:27:38,038
(Running down)

2214
01:27:38,738 --> 01:27:40,168
(He goes through the fridge in his parents' place.)

2215
01:27:41,338 --> 01:27:43,538
(Cold ramyeon is the best for health.)

2216
01:27:44,708 --> 01:27:46,608
(If I leave it like that, my mom will take care of it.)

2217
01:27:46,608 --> 01:27:47,678
(Happy)

2218
01:27:48,448 --> 01:27:49,908
(I love it.)

2219
01:27:50,308 --> 01:27:51,348
(Glancing over)

2220
01:27:51,348 --> 01:27:52,748
(He grabs a book.)

2221
01:27:53,848 --> 01:27:55,388
(Gosh, they're from my golden age.)

2222
01:27:55,918 --> 01:27:57,088
(Kim Dong Young's golden age)

2223
01:27:58,388 --> 01:28:00,018
(I was a bit of a star.)

2224
01:28:00,918 --> 01:28:03,358
(He commanded the playground in his golden age.)

2225
01:28:04,258 --> 01:28:06,028
(This place is a must.)

2226
01:28:07,328 --> 01:28:08,928
(Successful celebrities from Guri)

2227
01:28:08,928 --> 01:28:10,628
(DOYOUNG)

2228
01:28:11,398 --> 01:28:13,238
(Eating the love-filled food replenishes his energy.)

2229
01:28:14,038 --> 01:28:17,468
(In Body and Mind, I'm Always in My Golden Age)
